WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.600
Your mind files a ticket for every thought.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.100
Close them all? It just files more.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:11.500
The Attention Lab. Six small experiments in letting go of the fix.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.900
Give the mind one thing to hold.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.600
Stop steering every second.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.700
Debug the beliefs you run on.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.900
Then… leave a little room for quiet.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.000
It comes with the book. Send your receipt to selfdrivingmind.receipt@gmail.com

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.400
— and the Lab opens up.
